<section class="about-hero">
  <div class="container about-hero-grid">
    <div class="about-hero-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">About Waithaka Ndegwa</span><h1>The story behind the lens.</h1><p>I was born and raised in Charity, Endarasha, Nyeri County. A rural beginning taught me to notice how land, livelihoods, infrastructure, institutions and opportunity meet in ordinary life.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button button-primary" href="#roots">Start with Nyeri</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="<?=url('/my-thoughts')?>">Read My Thoughts</a></div></div>
    <div class="about-hero-media" data-reveal><figure><img <?=responsive_image_attrs(asset('images/journey/conversation.webp'))?> alt="Waithaka Ndegwa in conversation during a professional engagement" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><figure><img <?=responsive_image_attrs(asset('images/journey/early-learning.webp'))?> alt="An early learning moment" loading="eager" decoding="async"></figure><div class="about-caption"><span>Nyeri roots</span><strong>A perspective shaped close to the land — and widened by experience.</strong></div></div>
